  "details": "1. Create a config.json file in the standard way\n\n2. Assign a \"picture_output_folder\" path\n\n3. Delete the now-obsolete \"VRChat\" folder in your Users/___/Pictures directory, if you haven't yet\n\n4. Launch VRChat\n\n5. The Users/___/Pictures/VRChat folder immediately returns.\n\nBefore you think that I've done something wrong with my config.json file, here's the remaining steps:\n\n6. Take a picture in VRChat.\n\n7. The picture appears in the location specified in the config.json file!\n\n8. The Users/___/Pictures/VRChat folder remains empty!  It's being re-created on each launch even though nothing is ever put there now.",
